### PostgreSQL (Supabase) — core tables
 
```
users, profiles, consents, integrations(oauth tokens→vault refs)
trips, calendar_events
conversations, messages
agents(registry), agent_runs, tasks
recommendations, proposed_actions, actions, approvals, audit_log
