`agent_runs` (debugging gold): `id, agent_name, agent_version, user_id, trip_id, conversation_id, mode, status, input, output, tokens_in, tokens_out, cost_usd, latency_ms, trace_id, started_at, completed_at, error`.
 
`actions`: `id, run_id, name, risk, params, idempotency_key UNIQUE, status(in_flight|succeeded|failed|reconciled), provider_ref, receipt, created_at, executed_at`.
 
### Redis
Queues (Celery/Arq), pub/sub for streaming events, tool-result cache (e.g., roaming plans per country, TTL 6h), rate limiting, distributed locks, hot context cache.
 
### Object storage
Policy documents, receipts, filled forms (PDFs).
 
